  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lfu - NIBIO - Agroforestry Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional capacity building on Agroforestry systems to enhance food security and improve adaptation to climate change in Malawi.

Introducing agroforestry methods will increase soil carbon and reduce GHG emissions and strengthen farmers resilience to climate change impacts (flash flooding, drought) .

Main competence partners: LUANAR and ICRAF
Under the &apos;Agriculture for development&apos; umbrella</narrative>
  </description>
